PAPER, STROKES, PLANTS, ANIMALS, SOUND EFFECTS
  All generated in code for this film (paper.py, engine.js, plants.js, scene.js, main.js, mix.py). No samples,
  photographs or third-party artwork.

FACTS (narration)
  Rainfall thresholds, spinifex (~1/5 of the land), eucalypts (800+ species, ~3/4 of forests), mountain ash
  (tallest flowering plant, ~100 m), rainforest (<1 % of the land), ~50 Ma widespread rainforest: general
  figures from standard Australian botany/ecology references (e.g. Australia's State of the Forests reports,
  Australian National Botanic Gardens). Rounded for narration.

